 Prices update automatically from our catalogue."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display font-bold text-gray-900 text-2xl mb-4","children":"The short answer"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Add up the watts of everything you want to keep running during a KPLC outage, multiply by the hours you need, and divide by 0.85 to allow for inverter losses. That gives the capacity, in watt-hours (Wh), to look for. Then check that the power station's AC output, in watts (W), is higher than everything you will run at the same time. Most Kenyan homes land between 1,000 Wh and 3,000 Wh."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display font-bold text-gray-900 text-2xl mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 1: list your appliances and their watts"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Every appliance has a power rating on its label or charger. If you cannot find it, these typical figures are a fair starting point — but the label on your own appliance always wins."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-[8px] my-6","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full text-sm bg-white","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 text-left","children":[["$","th",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-500 font-medium","children":"Appliance"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-500 font-medium","children":"Typical watts"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","LED bulb",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"LED bulb"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["10"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","Phone charging",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"Phone charging"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["10"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","Wi-Fi router",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"Wi-Fi router"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["15"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","TV decoder",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"TV decoder"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["20"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","CCTV kit (4 cameras + recorder)",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"CCTV kit (4 cameras + recorder)"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["40"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","Standing fan",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"Standing fan"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["50"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","Laptop",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"Laptop"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["60"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","TV (43-inch LED)",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"TV (43-inch LED)"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["100"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","Fridge (running)",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"Fridge (running)"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["150"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","Chest freezer (running)",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"Chest freezer (running)"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["200"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","Microwave",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"Microwave"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["1,000"," W"]}]]}],["$","tr","Electric kettle",{"className":"border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900","children":"Electric kettle"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-3 text-gray-900 font-mono","children":["2,000"," W"]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"A fridge or freezer only draws its running watts part of the time, because the compressor switches on and off, so real use over a day is usually lower than the figure above. Heating appliances — kettles, irons, cookers and water heaters — draw a lot of power; a power station can run them only if its AC output is high enough, and they drain the battery quickly."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display font-bold text-gray-900 text-2xl mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 2: decide how many hours you need"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Think about your usual outages. A short evening blackout needs a few hours of backup; a full-day outage needs much more. Solar panels change the picture: if the power station recharges during the day, it only needs to carry you through the night."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display font-bold text-gray-900 text-2xl mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 3: work out the capacity"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Capacity (Wh) = total watts × hours ÷ 0.85. Here are three worked examples, each with the lowest-priced in-stock power station we sell that covers it today:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6 my-6","children":[["$","div","Apartment",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6","style":{"boxShadow":"0 1px 3px rgba(16,24,40,0.04)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2","children":"Apartment"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm","children":["Running ","Wi-Fi router, 4 LED bulbs, a TV and a laptop"," — about ",215," W — for ",4," hours needs ",215," × ",4," ÷ 0.85 ≈"," ",["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-gray-900","children":["1,050"," Wh"]}],"."," ",["The ",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/bluetti/bluetti-ac180p","className":"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline","children":"BLUETTI AC180P"}]," (","1,440"," Wh, ","KES 76,000",") covers it."]]}]]}],["$","div","Family home",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6","style":{"boxShadow":"0 1px 3px rgba(16,24,40,0.04)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2","children":"Family home"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm","children":["Running ","a fridge, Wi-Fi router, a TV, 6 LED bulbs and a decoder"," — about ",345," W — for ",6," hours needs ",345," × ",6," ÷ 0.85 ≈"," ",["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-gray-900","children":["2,450"," Wh"]}],"."," ",["The ",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/bluetti/bluetti-homestar-3","className":"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline","children":"BLUETTI Homestar 3 Solution"}]," (","3,000"," Wh, ","KES 111,500",") covers it."]]}]]}],["$","div","Whole home",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6","style":{"boxShadow":"0 1px 3px rgba(16,24,40,0.04)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2","children":"Whole home"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm","children":["Running ","a fridge, a chest freezer, Wi-Fi, two TVs, 10 LED bulbs, a fan and CCTV"," — about ",755," W — for ",8," hours needs ",755," × ",8," ÷ 0.85 ≈"," ",["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-gray-900","ch